Package: aura
Architecture: arm64
Depends: asahi-scripts (>= 20260127.1), aurora-stage2-ctxr-slot, aurora-stage2-trial, uboot-aurora,
 ${aura:CtxrKernel}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: m1n1 (= 1.6.1.aurora19)
Conflicts: m1n1
Description: Aurora Silicon boot loader for Apple Silicon Macs
 aura is Aurora's boot loader, based on m1n1. This package carries the Stage 2
 object that update-m1n1 combines with U-Boot and the kernel's device trees,
 and the Stage 1 images the macOS installer enrolls.
 .
 Ordinary package updates refresh Stage 2 on the EFI system partition through
 update-m1n1's trial boot. They never enroll Stage 1.
